{
  "title": "Resting pulse\u2013RDW coupling: a small source-validation gain fails independent-cycle inflammation prediction",
  "abstract": "In 4,122 NHANES 2005\u20132006 and 4,927 separately sampled 2007\u20132008 adults, a centered resting-pulse \u00d7 RDW feature slightly improved source cross-validation but increased independent-cycle log-CRP MSE by 0.003530 (0.327%). Joint source-refit/target-PSU 95% interval [-0.000672, 0.017277]. Useful incremental prediction was not established.",
